    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adrenaline-filled experience in \u2600\ufe0f<strong>Solar Collision Control</strong>\u2600\ufe0f, a thrilling arcade action game where you control the sun in a dangerous space. Move the sun from side to side to dodge lethal obstacles and collect stars to maintain your energy as you face increasingly hazardous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a4594f81d61e2bc822545329ed47588a.poster.avif?t=1742987289\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a4594f81d61e2bc822545329ed47588a.webm?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a4594f81d61e2bc822545329ed47588a.mp4?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Dodge over 90 types of obstacles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Master different game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Complete special missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Upgrade your equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Write your name at the top of the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENT GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stars and unlock new types of game modes. Each offers unique gameplay, giving you a fresh way to face the chaos. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL MISSIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on unique challenges in special missions. Will you be able to complete each mission? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a559eaf8ec5ca614b6e27f4b8d936792.poster.avif?t=1742987289\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a559eaf8ec5ca614b6e27f4b8d936792.webm?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a559eaf8ec5ca614b6e27f4b8d936792.mp4?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EQUIPMENT UPGRADE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the different boosters to increase their positive effects and eliminate the negative ones.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEADERBOARDS AND ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the top spot on the leaderboards, earn challenging achievements, and prove you have what it takes to control the sun's power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adrenaline-filled experience in \u2600\ufe0f<strong>Solar Collision Control</strong>\u2600\ufe0f, a thrilling arcade action game where you control the sun in a dangerous space. Move the sun from side to side to dodge lethal obstacles and collect stars to maintain your energy as you face increasingly hazardous challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a4594f81d61e2bc822545329ed47588a.poster.avif?t=1742987289\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a4594f81d61e2bc822545329ed47588a.webm?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a4594f81d61e2bc822545329ed47588a.mp4?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Dodge over 90 types of obstacles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Master different game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Complete special missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Upgrade your equipment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2600\ufe0f Write your name at the top of the global leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIFFERENT GAME MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect stars and unlock new types of game modes. Each offers unique gameplay, giving you a fresh way to face the chaos. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL MISSIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on unique challenges in special missions. Will you be able to complete each mission? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a559eaf8ec5ca614b6e27f4b8d936792.poster.avif?t=1742987289\" width=604 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a559eaf8ec5ca614b6e27f4b8d936792.webm?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175690/extras/a559eaf8ec5ca614b6e27f4b8d936792.mp4?t=1742987289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EQUIPMENT UPGRADE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve the different boosters to increase their positive effects and eliminate the negative ones.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEADERBOARDS AND ACHIEVEMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the top spot on the leaderboards, earn challenging achievements, and prove you have what it takes to control the sun's power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
